# Tribute mini · aykin (Aykin, GIANT) · built 2026-11-02 from uploads/Aykin_OBJ_tts_nobase.obj
# GIANT tri-hex base: three 2" pointy hexes (lattice pitch 2"), outline inset 0.024" so it sits inside the board's hex faces; lip y 0.10 like every base. Units = inches (TTS scale 1.0).
# faces -Z: the facing marker sits at the front notch between the two front hexes (the triangle's front side); the back point is the single rear hex.
# body: Z-up source turned Y-up, facing -Z; crown 3.6" (head top; the raised club reaches 5.04"); feet centred on the base centroid. g base FIRST (player tint), g figure untinted; base + marker sample the flat 230-grey patch at u .92-.97, v .02-.05.
